---
/**
 * DevTerminal — animated terminal/CLI mockup of the developer integration flow:
 * connect the MCP server → api_search the live contract → create a booking +
 * take payment → react to a webhook. Lines animate in sequence (.wink-msg-*
 * keyframes in styles/tweaks.css).
 * Used on: /builders/ (hero, right column).
 *
 * The step-1 command mirrors the real connection documented on
 * /developers/mcp/ — `claude mcp add <name> <url> --transport http`, against
 * https://api.wink.travel/mcp, authenticated by interactive OAuth2 (PKCE) that
 * opens a browser tab to iam.wink.travel. Keep it in sync with that page: a
 * command here that does not actually work is worse than no command at all.
 *
 * ── SWAPPABLE INFOGRAPHIC ─────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Drop-in slot. To improve or replace the visual, edit ONLY the body of this
 * file — swap in a redesigned mockup, an inline <svg>, or an <img>. Keep the
 * component name + outer wrapper so the hero layout stays untouched.
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 */
---

<div class="relative">
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0d0524] shadow-2xl shadow-black/40 ring-1 ring-white/10">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3">
      <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]"></span>
      <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]"></span>
      <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#28c840]"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-xs text-white/40">wink · agent integration</span>
      <span class="ml-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300/80"><span class="size-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> live</span>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3.5 p-5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/85">
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-1">
        <p class="text-white/40"># 1 · connect an agent or coding client</p>
        <p><span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> claude mcp add wink</p>
        <p class="pl-5 text-white/70">https://api.wink.travel/mcp --transport http</p>
        <p class="text-white/55">→ browser sign-in at <span class="text-white/70">iam.wink.travel</span></p>
        <p class="text-emerald-300/90">✓ connected · OAuth2 + PKCE · no client secret</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-2">
        <p class="text-white/40"># 2 · find the operation, read the live contract</p>
        <p><span class="text-[#ff8a5c]">api_search</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">"create booking"</span></p>
        <p class="text-white/55">→ POST /bookings · <span class="text-white/70">wink://api/operation/createBooking</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-3">
        <p class="text-white/40"># 3 · create the booking, take payment</p>
        <p><span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> wink bookings create --rate rp_8421</p>
        <p class="text-emerald-300/90">201 · #WK-2X9F · paid via Wink</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-4">
        <p class="text-white/40"># 4 · react in real time</p>
        <p>on <span class="text-[#ff8a5c]">booking.created</span> <span class="text-white/40">→</span> fulfill &amp; reconcile<span class="ml-1 inline-block h-3.5 w-2 translate-y-0.5 animate-pulse rounded-[1px] bg-emerald-400/80"></span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
